# The kubeconfig of a site that proves its claims against a cluster, written by
# its own tools/cluster.sh. It holds an admin certificate and belongs to the
# host, not to the repository. The line stands in the seed rather than on the
# one site that has a cluster today: a site-local ignore is wiped by the next
# sync.sh, and this one was - on devops-helm, on 31.10.2026, which is how the
# line got here.
.cluster/
